    "images-with-text-scroll": {
      "type": "images-with-text-scroll",
      "blocks": {
        "image-with-text-1": {
          "type": "image_with_text",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/DSCF8626_copy.jpg",
            "subheading": "",
            "title": "materials",
            "content": "<p>In the world of high-end luxury rugs, the difference between good and extraordinary begins with material. At Corvo, we take time with this choice. Every fiber is selected for how it feels, how it wears over time, and how it lives in a space, not just how it looks.</p><p>We work with a wide range of exceptional fibers, from soft silks and refined plant-based yarns to natural wools chosen for their strength and comfort. Each rug is built as a balanced composition, where texture, weight, and light come together naturally. </p>",
            "link_text": "",
            "link_url": "",
            "link_style": "link"
          }
        },
        "image-with-text-2": {
          "type": "image_with_text",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/WhatsApp_Image_2026-01-05_at_20.18.57_4.jpg",
            "subheading": "",
            "title": "Design",
            "content": "<p>Every product is imagined and developed in our studio, with a focus on both form and function. Design begins with proportion, texture, and purpose, ensuring each piece feels intentional rather than decorative.</p><p>We consider how a rug will be used, how it will age, and how it will sit within a space. From the first sketch to the final weave, every decision is guided by balance, durability, and comfort underfoot.</p>",
            "link_text": "",
            "link_url": "",
            "link_style": "link"
          }
        },
        "image_with_text_TEk6dP": {
          "type": "image_with_text",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/IMG_5756.jpg",
            "subheading": "",
            "title": "Know-How",
            "content": "<p>Since the beginning of our production, morE than 50 years ago, responsibility has been a core value. It defines how we design, how we source our materials, and how we think about the longevity of our products, rather than trends.</p><p>We work with trusted partners and choose materials deliberately, aiming to reduce waste while maintaining the highest standards of quality </p><p>The result is a collection of pieces designed to live well in your space, today and for years to come.</p>",
            "link_text": "",
            "link_url": "",
            "link_style": "link"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "image-with-text-1",
        "image-with-text-2",
