    "1768065729940e4efa": {
      "type": "_blocks",
      "blocks": {
        "ai_gen_block_6e74ad8_HbkBhM": {
          "type": "ai_gen_block_6e74ad8",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/4.jpg",
            "image_border_radius": 0,
            "title": "BESPOKE SERVICE",
            "subheading": "We believe that each rug should be as unique as the space it adorns. Our process starts with a personalized design consultation, where our expert team collaborates with you to select fibers, structure, pile height, colors, and shapes.",
            "link_text": "Tailor your rug",
            "link_url": "shopify://pages/bespoke",
            "show_link_arrow": true,
            "heading_font": "instrument_sans_n4",
            "title_size": 20,
            "subheading_font": "nunito_n4",
            "subheading_size": 14,
            "link_font": "nunito_n4",
            "link_size": 14,
            "link_underline": "none",
            "accordion_title_font": "nunito_n4",
            "accordion_title_size": 14,
            "accordion_content_font": "nunito_n4",
            "accordion_content_size": 14,
            "accordion_1_title": "Yarn Concepts",
            "accordion_1_content": "<p>The fibers you choose set the foundation for your rug’s character. At Corvo, we offer a selection of premium materials, including Lyocell, New Zealand wool, natural wool, and jute. Each material brings its own unique texture and quality.</p>",
            "accordion_2_title": "Structure",
            "accordion_2_content": "<p>The structure of your rug influences its texture and overall feel. Cut pile rugs provide a plush, soft surface, ideal for creating a luxurious, comfortable feel underfoot, while loop pile rugs feature uncut loops that add durability and texture, perfect for introducing depth and visual interest. You can also combine both styles to create a unique blend tailored to your space.</p>",
            "accordion_3_title": "Pile Height",
            "accordion_3_content": "<p>Pile height, or the thickness of the rug’s surface, plays a key role in its comfort and appearance. A low pile rug offers a sleek, modern look and is easy to maintain, while a high pile rug provides a deeper, more sumptuous texture underfoot. Whether you prefer a subtle or more pronounced texture, pile height can be tailored to suit your space.</p>",
            "accordion_4_title": "Size & Shape",
            "accordion_4_content": "<p>At Corvo, every rug can be made to measure. Shapes can be regular or irregular, subtle or expressive, with no limitations on size, form, or proportion.</p>",
            "accordion_5_title": "Infinite Colors",
            "accordion_5_content": "<p>With our Infinite color service, you are able to create an exclusive and unique rug. Designed and produced to ensure a perfect harmony between design and space. </p>",
            "text_color": "#1c1c1c",
            "link_color": "#1c1c1c",
            "divider_color": "#e0e0e0"
          },
          "blocks": {}
        }
